      "chapter": "14. Poverty, Employment and Human Development",
      "q": "Key employment and welfare schemes?",
      "a": "MGNREGA 2005 (100 days of guaranteed rural wage employment; later reforms/replacement: verify), DAY-NRLM, DAY-NULM, PMAY (housing), PM-JAY/Ayushman Bharat (2018), PMKVY/Skill India (2015), Employment-Linked Incentive scheme (2025)."
